usage: __main__.py [-h] --model {tracknet,yolo11n,keypoint_rcnn} --video VIDEO
                   --output OUTPUT [--limit-s LIMIT_S] [--device DEVICE]

Run one model on actual timestamped video frames, without rally segmentation.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --model {tracknet,yolo11n,keypoint_rcnn}
  --video VIDEO
  --output OUTPUT
  --limit-s LIMIT_S
  --device DEVICE
